1419:                              * and hence on broker-side it is not expected to see a commit offset request
1420:                              * during CompletingRebalance phase; if it ever happens then broker would return
1421:                              * this error to indicate that we are still in the middle of a rebalance.
1422:                              * In this case we would throw a RebalanceInProgressException,
1423:                              * request re-join but do not reset generations. If the callers decide to retry they
