1896:      * @param timer Timer used to bound how long the consumer waits for the requests to be created, which in practice
1897:      *              is used to avoid using {@link Long#MAX_VALUE} to wait "forever"
1898:      */
1899:     private void sendFetches(Timer timer) {
1900:         try {
1901:             applicationEventHandler.addAndGet(new CreateFetchRequestsEvent(calculateDeadlineMs(timer)));
