165:     /**
166:      * Compile it to XML and save.
167:      *
168:      * <p>No exception will be thrown if the syntax is invalid. In any case, XMIR will
169:      * be generated and saved. Read it in order to find the errors,
170:      * at <tt>/object/errors</tt> XPath.</p>
171:      *
172:      * @return Parsed XML
173:      * @throws IOException If fails
174:      */
